# v28 OVERLAY (user 2026-10-31, "proceed"): v27 with ONE change -- no
# steering-change cost.
#
# WHY. v27 peaked at 0.450 on Town02 (400k) and then fell to 0.000 at 700k.
# Its eval records show failing episodes drove 10-14 m yet returned -10 to -19:
# -0.08 to -0.13 a step. The cost was |delta steer| (0..2, unscaled) charged
# every step -- about 0.2 a step with absolute actions, more than driving
# earns. The goal critic sat at -20..-48 from 450k, and with continuing worth
# that much less than nothing, ending the episode on a -1 crossing became the
# cheap way out: crossings rose and episodes shrank to 40 steps. The repo this
# reward follows (nisheeth-golakiya/carla-rl) pays distance only.
. "$REPO/slurm/v27_overlay.env"
export STEER_CHANGE_SCALE=0
